    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just watching it happen. like i'm standing on the edge of a cliff and the ground is just crumbling under my feet and there is nothing i can do to stop the fall. my business, the house... everything i built is just gone. i dont think i can even face my friends again. the shame is just too much. i just want the descent to stop.",
