      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're feeling a deep sense of despair and hopelessness, like the fall is irreversible and there's no way back up. Understandably, the thought of living through the aftermath of your failure is terrifying and feels like an unbearable outcome. But it's worth remembering that people who have faced similar struggles have been able to rebuild and find new paths forward - there may be a way to heal and rediscover yourself even in the midst of this darkness.",
      "source": "target",
